  "message": "I’m happy to help you get your mobile data working at its best! To start, I’ll guide you step by step. First, could you please provide your phone number? This will help me identify your account and assist you more effectively."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you! To help improve your mobile data speed, I’ll guide you through a few steps. First, let’s make sure your phone is set to use the fastest available network. Please set your network mode preference to '4G/5G preferred' on your phone. Let me know once you’ve done this, or if you need instructions on how to do it."
